title: Peasant Congress
card-image: img/cards/peasant_congress.svg?v=2
subtitle: Fight for the peasant soviets.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: (player_party = 'sr' or player_party = 'lsr') and peasant_congress_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; peasant_congress_timer = 5

The Soviets of Peasants' Deputies are the party's own organisations, and the Bolsheviks have none of their own. Whoever controls them controls the villages. [? if peasant_organised < 1 : (The party has hardly begun to organise them.) ?][? if peasant_organised >= 1 and peasant_organised < 2 : (The party has organised some of them.) ?][? if peasant_organised >= 2 : (The party has organised many of them.) ?]

- @call: Call a congress of peasants' deputies. (1 resource)
- @committees: Work through the village committees and the volost soviets.
- @coops: Support rural cooperatives and peasant credit.
- @easy_discard

@call
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no resources.
on-arrival: {!
RO.pay(Q, 1);
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 6, soldiers: 2});
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, -1);
Q.peasant_organised = (Q.peasant_organised || 0) + 1;
!}

Delegates from the provincial peasant soviets met for a week, and voted resolutions on the land, the war and the Assembly. It is the closest the party has to a parliament of its own.

@committees
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 4});
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -1});
Q.peasant_organised = (Q.peasant_organised || 0) + 0.5;
!}

Our agitators have worked the volost soviets, one by one, as they have always done. It is slow, and no other party can match it.

@coops
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 3, middle: 2});
RO.add(Q, {bread: 1, ruble: 1});
Q.resources += 1;
Q.coops = (Q.coops || 0) + 1;
!}

The rural cooperatives lend, buy and sell for the villages. They are the best argument for the party's land programme.
